  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of TOR for Service Contract on Economic Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;EUD Malawi will need the services of an expert to support the Delegation in &lt;u&gt;developing the Service Contract Terms of Reference TOR (in accordance to annex b8e)&lt;/u&gt; for use in launching a procurement tender procedure for a Service Contract that will implement a business enabling environment project. The business enabling environment project will support 6 institutions, Ministry of Trade and Industry, Malawi Investment and Trade Centre, Malawi Bureau of Standards, Competition and Fair Trading Commission, the Presidential Delivery Unit, and the Malawi Agricultural and Industrial Investment Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;In order to develop the Service Contract TOR, the TA will need to work in collaboration with the responsible focal person in the EUD and undertake the following:-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 36, 176);&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&lt;/span&gt;Consolidate the detailed inputs from previous work and synchronise with the Action Document&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 36, 176);&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&lt;/span&gt;Engage the 6 beneficiary institutions at technical level and clearly define the required support and translate those activities into outcomes/outputs in the Service Contract TOR template&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 36, 176);&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&lt;/span&gt;Develop a shadow costed budget in excel for the defined activities and rationalise the activities vis-&#xe0;-vis the available resource envelope.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define the expertise that will be required for the service contract and introduce the requirements in the Service Contract TOR&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
